  "postText": "<p><HTML><HEAD><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"></HEAD><body></p>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/4Y8iPDud3Wv4poNcPXS9t2Wam4aqoHR67gz3RutUwLZPIdvTWvClzeQADKAqSrTnZH1sk8c64WdkXjvvlT4P74ICNPK0fz0qi4XLbLi52DARyONiYjHO7MmTo9gVmLv7Wakb7y3ueuCiZef9zCNpPYrAK0uBef13P8cTIZ1X79cj3ozsGubpMOmBGY4ueW7kq8CPKoKy\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/271/335faa62313e2a822486df2fcf839bdb..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">今日はお祭りに行ってきましたよ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">なんと、ねこめさんと！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">超楽しかったな♡</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/XAdGtiNlrTzlXNkwFekdQ8dlkxzhLUlDx5b7SUfzE1MPWwpzuXS2EauafjlMW5mWlunVVWJkiVZwwQaDlaa13N5AjanxwHGJoH703aEJUzQK7B8PophdtNOinec24UxQuEGMswc633xV48MfcQkuotxs1LeQSVDPB0xvuH3i87AYb8wNdEC4DYgETbALAaoOr4j6q43M\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/271/83417c7c7266b37c2ea631d9d46e0f7a..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">調子乗ってピンクの浴衣買ってしまって</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">バカ目立って恥ずかしかった</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">もうこういう服着ないって100万回言ってるんだけども、、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/gKjGTsbtcrOEEXkIGD14bg73UEKOc1431S8foKq6OJ4Y4TgNburLiY7oV24a1Ns6L4OkEyCbcyArwrR2F2Km2fKdHGmG8WQEdUl68eE0v7AFFORXDR7WpFOws5TXHAQsasC4aiDAyAzUaaDeSxEuYIVB8l3wDUMVicqfrkxoPVaC11ENxZwmtL8uGwpRUtRqlW9Tz98W\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/271/15f45d0845571c693211edce0e0a8b44..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">屋台らしい屋台を沢山巡れて</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">嬉しかった</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/7SBMVOnDSXGXxU3pfWEHmaF8c3h6ViRiTew2BwxmtNjXK08BMFyeCJaKa7Eajdihvd9PtGlDh8um0mkRlp3NbRPui9LtxzOYmomW3ggwaQzaJmlRuhz4rgm1KrL0DqX43RZRIr3EMRqsZpYY9eZuIEnCCYeBBX2g4mJXraxVxZZlnSzDSV6X11Rioq0MZRzJyCUK38cx\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/271/2c18a965d32a3e19469235b6c633f8c9..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">日比谷の阿波踊り？見てきたよ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">みんな踊ってて凄かった</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">混ざりたかったけど、難しいそうで普通に無理でした</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ねこめさんに会うのはとっても久しぶりで</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">緊張もしたけど</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">そんなの忘れちゃうくらい</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">本当にずっと変わらず優しくて可愛くてかっこよくて</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">最高な推しです🥲</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">なつ、やっぱりだいすき</div>\n<div align=\"center\"></div>\n<p></body></HTML></p>\n",
